    },
    {
      "id": "claim_10973f5b89ca49efb76041b59ef72844",
      "statement": "apply_smoothing(current, factor) blends each zone with its previous value using an exponential moving average in xy space (smoothed = prev + factor*(current-prev) per xy component) and an int lerp for brightness; zones seen for the first time pass through unsmoothed, an empty current dict returns empty without touching previous_colors, and the smoothed dict replaces previous_colors each call. The sync loop passes settings.sync.smoothing_factor.",
      "evidence": [
